[size=6][b]✦ Fairer Weapon and Magic Experience Gain[/b][/size]

In vanilla Morrowind every cast and every hit teaches the same, so the fastest way to level is a 1-magicka spell or a dagger jab repeated a thousand times. Here experience follows what you actually do:

[list]
[*][b]Costly spells teach more.[/b] Fire Bite (6 magicka) teaches as in vanilla, Lightning Storm (34) 2.3x, anything from 75 magicka up 5x.
[*][b]Slow weapons teach more per hit, fast ones less.[/b] A dagger hit teaches about 0.6x, a long sword 1.15x, a two-handed axe 1.3x, a bow 1.9x. An attack wound up all the way teaches a third more.
[*][b]Miscasts and misses still teach a little[/b], up to the skill's next level.
[*][b]Bound gear also trains Conjuration[/b], and hits taken under a shield spell train Alteration.
[/list]

Every number is a setting: Options -> Scripts -> Fairer Weapon and Magic Experience Gain.

